  << /ActualText (Our project takes PDF sheet music and will output an image with the pitches and type of notehead\056 Our pipeline extracts individual notes using computer vision\054 and outputs the pitches and types of notes in the music\056 We train a convolutional neural network to detect and localize musical notes from preprocessed images derived from the DoReMI dataset\056 \n\nOur approach combines supervised learning\054 image segmentation\054 and CNN\055based detection to extract relevant features from sheet music\054 which could eventually be used to automate the creation of OMR\137XML files\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 2722 0 R
     /Pg 2704 0 R
